  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Thieving Heaven’s dream realm, after red light ages an oasis settlement to death, Sha Xiao tells young Thieving Heaven he owns steal life Immortal Gu. The light gathers into a scarlet bee, enters his hand, and returns the stolen lifespan to him. Sha Xiao names it a rank six Immortal Gu gift.",
        "chapters": [
          1511
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_sha_xiao",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After rebirth Fang Yuan declines Long Hair refinement path true meaning from Lang Ya land spirit and chooses steal life Immortal Gu from the compensation list, along with listed time path Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1750
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Steal life Immortal Gu at rank eight is part of Thieving Heaven’s true inheritance held in Lang Ya blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          1758
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance",
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After he suppresses Lang Ya land spirit and takes that inheritance, he can use the Gu as the core of the immortal killer move Steal Life, which targets only the enemy, while the three-use limit remains.",
        "chapters": [
          1759
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "move_steal_life"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Rumors call it the first Immortal Gu he obtained.",
        "chapters": [
          1751
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rumors-and-will",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
